1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,224
一家店明明卖得不错，老板为什么还是不敢继续进货？
Sales look strong. Why is the owner afraid to restock?

2
00:00:04,224 --> 00:00:09,285
因为卖得多，不代表库存周转得快。
Strong sales do not always mean fast inventory turnover.

3
00:00:09,285 --> 00:00:11,165
这背后有一个重要的商业概念。
There is an important business concept behind this.

4
00:00:11,165 --> 00:00:12,720
Inventory Turnover，库存周转率。
Inventory Turnover.

5
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:17,401
简单来说，就是一段时间内，库存被销售消耗了多少轮。
It measures how many times inventory is sold through in a period.

6
00:00:17,401 --> 00:00:18,955
我们算一笔账。
Let us run the numbers.

7
00:00:18,955 --> 00:00:20,880
以下数据全部是假设。
All the following figures are hypothetical.

8
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:25,289
假设两家店，一年卖出的商品成本都是十二万美元。
Assume both stores have annual cost of goods sold of $120,000.

9
00:00:25,289 --> 00:00:28,737
第一家店，平均库存成本只有一万美元。
Store A holds just $10,000 in average inventory at cost.

10
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:32,420
十二万除以一万，库存周转率是十二次。
$120,000 ÷ $10,000 gives 12 inventory turns per year.

11
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,673
第二家店呢？
What about Store B?

12
00:00:33,673 --> 00:00:36,282
平均库存成本高达四万美元。
Its average inventory at cost is $40,000.

13
00:00:36,282 --> 00:00:37,999
十二万除以四万，库存周转率只有三次。
$120,000 ÷ $40,000 gives only 3 turns per year.

14
00:00:37,999 --> 00:00:40,585
等等！
Wait!

15
00:00:40,585 --> 00:00:44,286
两家店一年卖出的商品成本明明一样。
Both stores have exactly the same annual cost of goods sold.

16
00:00:44,286 --> 00:00:46,938
为什么库存周转率差了四倍？
Why is one turnover rate four times the other?

17
00:00:46,938 --> 00:00:50,718
因为第二家店，平均有更多资金压在库存里。
Store B has more cash tied up in inventory on average.

18
00:00:50,718 --> 00:00:55,559
按简单计算，第一家店的平均库存周转天数大约是三十天。
A simple estimate puts Store A at about 30 inventory days.

19
00:00:55,559 --> 00:00:58,151
第二家店却要大约一百二十二天。
Store B takes about 122 days.

20
00:00:58,151 --> 00:01:05,370
库存周转慢，可能意味着更多仓储成本、更大的积压风险，以及更紧张的现金流。
Slow turnover may mean more storage cost, stock risk and cash pressure.

21
00:01:05,370 --> 00:01:08,193
当然，周转率也不是越高越好。
But a higher turnover rate is not always better.

22
00:01:08,193 --> 00:01:12,119
库存太少，可能导致缺货，错过销售机会。
Too little inventory can cause stockouts and lost sales.

23
00:01:12,119 --> 00:01:15,336
所以，老板真正需要的，不是盲目减少库存。
So the goal is not to cut inventory blindly.

24
00:01:15,336 --> 00:01:18,536
而是在满足客户需求的同时，控制库存占用。
Meet customer demand while managing cash tied up in stock.

25
00:01:18,536 --> 00:01:20,432
记住：
Remember:

26
00:01:20,432 --> 00:01:23,370
销售额告诉你卖了多少。
Sales tell you how much you sold.

27
00:01:23,370 --> 00:01:27,278
库存周转率告诉你，库存使用得有多有效率。
Inventory turnover tells you how efficiently stock is used.

28
00:01:27,278 --> 00:01:29,815
这就是，数据看生意。
This is Business in Numbers.
